Date: Fri, 18 Jul 2025 18:13:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 545/913] prod/optee/stm32mp2: add OPP backend for DVFS support

Add a module STM32 OPP as backend of CPU DVFS based on SCP clock API.
The clock API level is the minimal level to use the OP-TEE OPP driver
with SCP DVFS module as we can't implement a specific DVFS driver
in SCP firmware.

As the voltage is managed in OP-TEE OPP driver, the PSU required for
DVFS module is stubbed with a OP-TEE PSU with a NULL regulator.

NB: the OP-TEE clock module can't be used here, based on a OP-TEE OPP
    clock, because this module use directly the OP-TEE clock framework
    which add too many restrictions (it is no  allowed to call clock API
    in  clock ops).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git bbde3cc83543644faffb9fdb9f046a52a4668679 prod/optee/stm32mp2: add OPP backend for DVFS support]
